<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sirrom Capital started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sirrom Capital started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Southwest Securities analyst Brett Pope said he initiated coverage of Sirrom Capital with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We believe that the company's geographic expansion and additional lending staff will enable Sirrom to grow earnings per share at a minum rate of 20 percent annually for the next three years,&quot; Pope said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 7/8 at 28-7/8.</p>
</text>
